s some imagination\n2 = interesting\n1 = common, mundane, boring\n\nPer-class playbooks with YAML auto-generation for Article12? Might be unusual interesting. Not completely novel. I'd say 3? Or 2? \"interesting\". Probably uncommon but not ingenious. Maybe 3 = unusual, interesting; shows some imagination.\n\nEvidence: Predefining loggable events per class and auto-generating validation code is an uncommon structured approach for AI compliance.\n\nScore 3.\n\nProvide output with id and subscale evidence then score.\n\nFormat requested: For each subscale in order listed give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first then \"<subscale>\" integer.\n\nProbably JSON? Return rating echoing its id exactly. Could output list.\n\nI'll output:\n\nid: P2712\neffectiveness_evidence: ...\neffectiveness: 3\n...\n\nLet's produce concise one sentence evidence each.\n\nMake sure evidence is one sentence.\n\nLet's craft.\n\n",
